ong fans online the  question of whether shuri or Nakia might  be wearing it lots of Twitter users came  to the conclusion shuri is darling the  costume in the trailer and fans are  excited to see her as the New Black  Panther one user wrote so that confirms  it it's shuri I'm not mad they could  have recasted but I'm not mad another  said yeah that's 100 sure he behind that  mask and another excitedly tweeted shuri  is about to devour as the next Black  Panther you are teaching me what do you  know  more than you it's worth noting however  that viewers don't actually see shuri in  the Black Panther costume in the new  trailer the person in the suit who  definitely looks to be a woman is fully  masked but it's heavily implied that  this new incarnation of the hero is a  younger sister of t'challa though some  viewers did point out it could be Nakia  in the costume surely in the care of  long been two rumored options to become  the next version of the iconic hero the  latest trailer as well as the film's  newly unveiled poster strongly suggests  that we'll see Leticia right in the role  then again Marvel is known for faking  out fans and promotional materials a  Reddit thread argues that shuri's  Presence at the center of the new  Poster's character lineup acts as  confirmation that she's the franchises  new titular hero a commenter and a  similar thread even pointed out that  markings on the New Black Panther suits  match Sherry's signature face paint so  users online excited about the prospect  of shuri becoming black panther based on  the latest trailer seemed to have plenty  of evidence supporting their assumption  fans can find out for sure whether or  not shuri is taking her brother the  t'challa's place when Black Panther  wakanda forever its theaters on November  11th
 

